            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>load_dotenv</code> kullanımını etkinleştirmek için doğru kütüphaneyi içe aktar.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" dotenv\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" os\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"dotenv.load_dotenv()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"api_key = os.getenv(\" /><text value=\"&quot;API_KEY&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(api_key)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"13\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"12345-abcde-67890-fghij-12345\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>dotenv</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
