          {
            "title": "Lesson #4 - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 131979,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kullanılabilir tüm ortam değişkenlerini yazdırmak için doğru metodu kullan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" os\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(os.environ)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getenv\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;API_KEY&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"environ({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;API_KEY&quot;: &quot;12345-abcde-67890-fghij-12345&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;SECRET_KEY&quot;: &quot;mysecretkey&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  ...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"})\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>os</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve son olarak <code>environ</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ortam sözlüğünü kullanarak <code>API_KEY</code> değerini oku, ardından kullanılabilir tüm ortam değişkenlerini yazdır.</p><p>Sözlüğü <code>variables</code> içinde sakla. Önce anahtar değerini, sonra sözlüğün tamamını yazdır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"os\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"variables\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"os\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"environ\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"variables\" /><text value=\"[\" /><text value=\"&quot;API_KEY&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"variables\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"77\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getenv\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;SECRET_KEY&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"variables[&quot;API_KEY&quot;]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"12345-abcde-67890-fghij-12345\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"environ({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;API_KEY&quot;: &quot;12345-abcde-67890-fghij-12345&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;SECRET_KEY&quot;: &quot;mysecretkey&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  ...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"})\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>os</code>, ardından <code>environ</code>, <code>\"API_KEY\"</code> ve son olarak <code>variables</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4 - Copy -  - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 131980,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>os.environ</code> sözlüğünde aradığımız değer bulunmuyorsa varsayılan bir değer ayarladığından emin ol.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" os\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"api_key = os.environ.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;NON_EXISTENT_KEY&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;default_value&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(api_key)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getenv\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"default_value\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>get</code>, ardından <code>\"NON_EXISTENT_KEY\"</code> ve sonra <code>,</code>, <code>\"default_value\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>os.environ</code> sözlüğünde ihtiyacın olan anahtar yoksa kullanılacak bir varsayılan değer ayarla.</p><p>Programın <code>default_value</code> yazdırması için <code>NON_EXISTENT_KEY</code> değerini güvenli bir şekilde al.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" os\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"api_key = os.environ.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;NON_EXISTENT_KEY&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;default_value&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(api_key)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"os.getenv\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"set\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;MY_API_KEY&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;missing&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"default_value\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>os.environ</code>, ardından <code>get</code>, <code>\"NON_EXISTENT_KEY\"</code> ve son olarak <code>\"default_value\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 131984,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ortam değişkeni mevcut değilse <code>os.getenv(\"NON_EXISTENT_KEY\", \"default\")</code> ne döndürür?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"default\"</code> döndürecek</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hata verecek</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>None</code> döndürecek</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"default\"</code> döndürecek.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ortamında <code>REGION=eu</code> var ancak <code>MODE</code> anahtarı yok.</p><p><code>os.getenv(\"REGION\", \"local\")</code> ve <code>os.getenv(\"MODE\", \"dev\")</code> sırasıyla ne döndürür?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"eu\"</code>, ardından <code>\"dev\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"local\"</code>, ardından <code>\"dev\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"eu\"</code>, ardından <code>None</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"eu\"</code>, ardından <code>\"dev\"</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
